{"id":"n59415-1-9","stage":5,"title":"분기 · 季度","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59415-1-9-1","ko":"지수씨, 저는 다음 분기에 잠시 다른 부서에서 일할 예정이에요.","zh":"智秀，我下个季度要暂时去别的部门工作。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수씨,","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。；智秀","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬；지수：智秀。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수씨","audio":"/audio/8615b9af13bca89f0c40.mp3"}},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저는","audio":"/audio/0b05af6c0b14d6e70820.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"분기에","meaning":"季度","explanation":"분기：季度；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"분기","audio":"/audio/22e0133718e821f2902b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59415","senseId":"1","lemma":"분기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분기에","audio":"/audio/63168e1422a22c8eafa7.mp3"}},{"text":"잠시","meaning":"片刻，暂时","explanation":"잠시：片刻，暂时。","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71203","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的。","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"부서에서","meaning":"部门","explanation":"부서：部门；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"부서","audio":"/audio/57bcfb6e119961a2aa23.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26317","senseId":"1","lemma":"부서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부서에서","audio":"/audio/ef67bec8899ebdf30b03.mp3"}},{"text":"일할","meaning":"工作","explanation":"일하다：工作；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"일하다","audio":"/audio/3313fc8f7aeacdfbc30f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57309","senseId":"2","lemma":"일하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일할","audio":"/audio/2a5261d0a11098a57d44.mp3"}},{"text":"예정이에요.","meaning":"预定","explanation":"예정：预定；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"예정","audio":"/audio/8688e9ff7c84e0e44571.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66576","senseId":"1","lemma":"예정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예정이에요","audio":"/audio/5225adad481b5f7ff182.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"22e0133718e821f2","term":"분기","zh":"季度","audio":"/audio/22e0133718e821f2902b.mp3","entryId":"59415","definition":"将一年的时间四等分时，每一等份的三个月时间。","pronunciation":["분기"]},{"id":"6fcdfa8c124ab5cb","term":"잠시","zh":"片刻，暂时","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3","entryId":"71203","definition":"一小会儿。","pronunciation":["잠ː시"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"57bcfb6e119961a2","term":"부서","zh":"部门","audio":"/audio/57bcfb6e119961a2aa23.mp3","entryId":"26317","definition":"公司、机关、组织中按照工作的性质分成的多个业务单位。","pronunciation":["부서"]},{"id":"3313fc8f7aeacdfb","term":"일하다","zh":"工作","audio":"/audio/3313fc8f7aeacdfbc30f.mp3","entryId":"57309","definition":"以某种职业或资格进行活动，或在某个职位上活动。","pronunciation":["일ː하다"]},{"id":"8688e9ff7c84e0e4","term":"예정","zh":"预定","audio":"/audio/8688e9ff7c84e0e44571.mp3","entryId":"66576","definition":"提前定下或预想将来的事情。","pronunciation":["예ː정"]}],"audio":"/audio/8821b5e7b98dfe9c0a17.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59415-1-9-2","ko":"그래요? 그럼 사월에서 유월까지는 자주 못 보겠네요.","zh":"是吗？那从四月到六月我们就很难经常见面了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래요?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래요","audio":"/audio/b6894238d8eae709ebfd.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"사월에서","meaning":"四月","explanation":"사월：四月；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"사월","audio":"/audio/00364411159b0afea5a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20228","senseId":"1","lemma":"사월","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사월에서","audio":"/audio/3d4f86dbfbf1c4c63f74.mp3"}},{"text":"유월까지는","meaning":"六月","explanation":"유월：六月；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"유월","audio":"/audio/e3284c0596dfe56979fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70633","senseId":"1","lemma":"유월","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유월까지는","audio":"/audio/6199203ac484b4f47a0c.mp3"}},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常。","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"보겠네요.","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보겠네요","audio":"/audio/d50e77e4b498de9f41e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"00364411159b0afe","term":"사월","zh":"四月","audio":"/audio/00364411159b0afea5a2.mp3","entryId":"20228","definition":"一年十二个月中的第四个月。","pronunciation":["사ː월"]},{"id":"e3284c0596dfe569","term":"유월","zh":"六月","audio":"/audio/e3284c0596dfe56979fb.mp3","entryId":"70633","definition":"一年十二个月中的第六个月。","pronunciation":["유월"]},{"id":"604b383d216f9452","term":"자주","zh":"常常，经常","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3","entryId":"71199","definition":"重复做同样事情的间隔短暂地。","pronunciation":["자주"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，见，见面","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"与别人相见。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cebf2437e903380dd35f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.514,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=59415","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":169,"sequenceScore":3.3407,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？那从四月到六月我们就很难经常见面了。","智秀，我下个季度要暂时去别的部门工作。","本来好好的公寓，为什么会突然倒塌呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀，我下个季度要暂时去别的部门工作。","本来好好的公寓，为什么会突然倒塌呢？","是吗？那从四月到六月我们就很难经常见面了。"],"answer":2}]}
